:"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/animation(_:body:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/animation(_:body:)","title":"animation(_:body:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/animation(_:body:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"animation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"V","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Animation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9AnimationV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"body","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlaceholderContentView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI22PlaceholderContentViewV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"V"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text